<p>Increases all your summons' max life by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">11%, 15%, 18%, 20%, 22%</acronym> and extends your summons' maximum lifetime by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 2, 3, 4, 4</acronym> turns.</p>